{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lootbound",
    "steam_appid": 3091140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.mp4?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Lootbound, a turn based adventure about golems, ancient gods, chance, and survival deep underground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.mp4?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of abandoned golems, cast into the darkness with only scraps of memory and a stubborn instinct to move forward. Your goal is to find your creators, escape the depths, and reach the surface. <br> <br>Assemble a squad of four distinct heroes. Each has their own backstory, personality, class, and skill tree. Bard, warrior, healer, mage \u2014 your choices shape your tactics, and progression opens up new abilities and playstyles. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7697d5dd43883760aa8444e059d29214.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7697d5dd43883760aa8444e059d29214.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, fate throws the dice. Roll for blessings or curses that will shape your entire expedition. Lootbound is about risk and randomness, about adapting to what the world throws at you and making it work. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9efa08665e0d3c474c7a4655142d0946.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9efa08665e0d3c474c7a4655142d0946.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons shrouded in the fog of war. Discover and activate obelisks \u2014 self contained challenges with battles, loot, and tough choices. <br> <br>Every encounter is a tactical puzzle. Abilities cost action points, and every decision matters. Victory earns you equipment, but your inventory is limited, so you\u2019ll need to prioritize. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/e1e09b7edae43163f3fee2a39c34b9b7.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/e1e09b7edae43163f3fee2a39c34b9b7.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>What sets it apart: <br>Procedurally generated dungeons with fog of war <br>Rich RPG systems with classes, skills, upgrades, and dice rolls <br>Turn based tactical combat that rewards thoughtful planning <br>You decide what the final boss becomes <br>Nonlinear storylines, dynamic events, and party conversations <br>Rare gear, strange effects, and deadly traps <br>Divine aid and unique powers tied to each character<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ad21c392c7153d44efb1d2f5bac3d35d.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=1070 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ad21c392c7153d44efb1d2f5bac3d35d.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>To escape, you\u2019ll have to reclaim something vital \u2014 your humanity. <br> <br>It\u2019s not just about survival. <br> <br>It\u2019s about unraveling your origin, defeating the Guardians, and deciding who you\u2019ll become: a puppet, a soldier, or something more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.mp4?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Lootbound, a turn based adventure about golems, ancient gods, chance, and survival deep underground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.mp4?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of abandoned golems, cast into the darkness with only scraps of memory and a stubborn instinct to move forward. Your goal is to find your creators, escape the depths, and reach the surface. <br> <br>Assemble a squad of four distinct heroes. Each has their own backstory, personality, class, and skill tree. Bard, warrior, healer, mage \u2014 your choices shape your tactics, and progression opens up new abilities and playstyles. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7697d5dd43883760aa8444e059d29214.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7697d5dd43883760aa8444e059d29214.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, fate throws the dice. Roll for blessings or curses that will shape your entire expedition. Lootbound is about risk and randomness, about adapting to what the world throws at you and making it work. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9efa08665e0d3c474c7a4655142d0946.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9efa08665e0d3c474c7a4655142d0946.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons shrouded in the fog of war. Discover and activate obelisks \u2014 self contained challenges with battles, loot, and tough choices. <br> <br>Every encounter is a tactical puzzle. Abilities cost action points, and every decision matters. Victory earns you equipment, but your inventory is limited, so you\u2019ll need to prioritize. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/e1e09b7edae43163f3fee2a39c34b9b7.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/e1e09b7edae43163f3fee2a39c34b9b7.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>What sets it apart: <br>Procedurally generated dungeons with fog of war <br>Rich RPG systems with classes, skills, upgrades, and dice rolls <br>Turn based tactical combat that rewards thoughtful planning <br>You decide what the final boss becomes <br>Nonlinear storylines, dynamic events, and party conversations <br>Rare gear, strange effects, and deadly traps <br>Divine aid and unique powers tied to each character<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ad21c392c7153d44efb1d2f5bac3d35d.poster.avif?t=1755264284\" width=1024 height=1070 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ad21c392c7153d44efb1d2f5bac3d35d.webm?t=1755264284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>To escape, you\u2019ll have to reclaim something vital \u2014 your humanity. <br> <br>It\u2019s not just about survival. <br> <br>It\u2019s about unraveling your origin, defeating the Guardians, and deciding who you\u2019ll become: a puppet, a soldier, or something more.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lootbound is a tactical roguelike with turn based combat, inventory management, and a touch of D&amp;D flavor, all set in a dark fantasy world. Lead your squad through winding dungeon corridors built by the Mysterious Master, filled with traps, riddles, and monsters.",
